{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic platformer with hand-drawn graphics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black and white visual style. An adventure on the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character flew to the moon to find a bride. The locals greeted him with disbelief. The hero will have to pass the tests and show his courage. Only then will everyone love him. It's not going to be an easy adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many jumps waiting for you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different monsters in the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The big bosses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging skill levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes there will be puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pleasant and moderately challenging platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a great way to while away an evening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of classic platformers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068650?t=1759924940","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068650?t=1759924940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/142e2580dac6ff4d22b376aebab723f63a03c054/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759924940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/142e2580dac6ff4d22b376aebab723f63a03c054/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759924940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic platformer with hand-drawn graphics and animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black and white visual style. An adventure on the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character flew to the moon to find a bride. The locals greeted him with disbelief. The hero will have to pass the tests and show his courage. Only then will everyone love him. It's not going to be an easy adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many jumps waiting for you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different monsters in the game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The big bosses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging skill levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes there will be puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pleasant and moderately challenging platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a great way to while away an evening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of classic platformers.</p>","developers":["Anatoliy Loginovskikh"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068650/44f6652a1ab49ffe6cf329975b10ac5b0de9d87a/header.jpg?t=1759924940","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4068650/1030448839/b93b524d0835c07461d4d25af2fef5e32bb3b09e/1759290205/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759772043","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4068650/1030448839/b93b524d0835c07461d4d25af2fef5e32bb3b09e/1759290205/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759772043","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4068650/1030448839/b93b524d0835c07461d4